 the Question 1 with the corresponding letter numbering>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<Respond to the Question 2 with the corresponding letter numbering>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## Scenario\nHannah is a massive fan of the Backstreet Boys. She had a poster hanging on her room's wall and had it signed when she went to the fan meeting with them. One day, Hannah and her sister were studying together in her room. Accidentally, her sister ripped the poster. Thinking it was just a poster, her sister offered to buy a new one.\n\n## Question 1\nWhat emotion(s) would Hannah's sister ultimately feel in this situation?\n\n## Choices for Question 1\nA) Disgust\nB) Joy\nC) Jealousy\nD) Nervousness\nE) Embarrassment\nF) Unbothered\n\n## Question 2\nWhy would Hannah's sister feel these emotions in this situation?\n\n## Choices for Question 2\nA) She thinks Hannah is overreacting\nB) She didn't think the poster had any value\nC) She can easily afford to buy a new poster\nD) She's jealous of Hannah's fan following of Backstreet Boys","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.005909218520129908,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a0ba9aa9dc5a833d8e16","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794482362621,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:19:22","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"88a9dc6d13574297baa316c290b34420"}